# Build context allowlist for fe-admin/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Last matching line wins: the exclusions below must stay after the `!` lines.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!fe-admin/
fe-admin/node_modules
fe-admin/dist
fe-admin/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.log
fe-admin/test
fe-admin/coverage
